WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
In Three builds one owned path from your machine to Farcaster.

00:06.000 --> 00:18.000
Command one prepares the machine. Command two turns it into a Snapchain node. Command three opens your client.

00:18.000 --> 00:30.000
The node catches up one shard at a time, verifies each snapshot, and then follows new blocks.

00:30.000 --> 00:39.000
Your recovery phrase stays encrypted on your machine. The client gets a revocable app key.

00:39.000 --> 00:55.000
When you cast, the client signs. Your node verifies and relays. Validators order it, and the updated feed returns through your node.

00:55.000 --> 00:59.000
Your client. Your node. Farcaster, in three.
